  what: 'Kaneo web: React 19 + TanStack Router/Query + Radix/base-ui + Tailwind 4 + Tiptap 3 + dnd-kit + i18next, dark mode. Views board, list, backlog, calendar, gantt (no table); task detail both as a side sheet and a full page; per-project filters in localStorage, no saved views; inbox with all/unread/mentions grouped today/earlier; command menu; public read-only project page.',
